(text "Green LEDs show rail presence only, not regulated voltage accuracy or ESP32 execution.\nHEAT (B/D8): 5 V driver output after PWM AND ENABLE; brightness follows duty, NOT measured heater current.\nNTC on B/J4: 1 = +3V3_B, 2 = NTC_RAW; passive two-wire 15k B3920 probe, either wire orientation." (at 20 377 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 33be59a3-f278-52df-9629-6b5699c07216)))
